@meeting crossingBackAddress.ask
// The Captain's final address when you haven't answered the offer, or said "not sure" (E-1, EN2; plans/ending-spec.html,
// question 2's recommended answer): she asks you at the front, before the crowd, with Stay and Go only; the game never
// decides for you. Your answer plays crossingBackAddress.stay or .go after it (section 18's crossingBackPick). A stand-in.
title: The Captain's address
from: Captain Odile Marrow
gist: The Captain asked you before the crew: stay aboard the Wren, or go to headquarters.
== lines
marrow: One more thing. Headquarters offered {me} a post, and I said I'd ask them here, at the Line.   [gesture]
marrow > you: So. In front of everyone. The Wren, or headquarters?
? choice
* I'm staying.   flag:end.cb.stay
* I'm going.   flag:end.cb.go
